  "gaps": [
    "Scope Unit and Package complete inherited Relation whitelists and endpoint/cardinality rules require review; selected relations do not close whitelist.",
    "Project.Settings and Project.Framework Settings direct dependent-property sets and counts are unresolved; known Name/Prefix are declared separately without claiming they exhaust the set.",
    "Framework Settings children and their encodings are existing source-backed candidates outside the selected slice; do not guess them or retire their sources.",
    "Parent and Children transition from direct property fields to IS_CONTAINED_BY / derived CONTAINS needs carrier and consumer migration; no new storage key or duplicate Property Declaration was invented.",
    "Current Package permits other contained kinds and non-root parent rules; unselected contained-kind Declarations and the Project Implementation root case remain for later review.",
    "Scope Unit.Path, Project Boundary Position and Local/Navigation order are current properties; determine which are derived in the new graph before adoption."
  ],
  "constraints": [
    "Scope Unit, Project and Package each classify as Container; classification is not inherited. Project inherits Scope Unit properties without a duplicate Project.Name Declaration.",
    "Instances and unselected primary kinds remain deferred.",
    "Current Relation names IS_CONTAINED_BY / CONTAINS retained."
  ],
